all-transcripts/2023/05/08/biontech-se-bntx-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2023 Q1","e":"bntx","d":"2023-05-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jens Holstein","x":"You know, we reiterated the guidance, as I stated in my speech before.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/08/biontech-se-bntx-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2023 Q2","e":"bntx","d":"2023-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ryan Richardson","x":"We plan to connect these AI-enabled discovery capabilities with automated lab infrastructure to enable high-throughput drug discovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/07/biontech-se-bntx-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2023 Q2","e":"bntx","d":"2023-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ryan Richardson","x":"While we do expect our overall AI investments to increase in the coming years, we do expect some mid-term cost efficiencies from the acquisition by internalizing our largest AI technology and services provider.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/07/biontech-se-bntx-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2023 Q2","e":"bntx","d":"2023-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jens Holstein","x":"While in Q2, some cost savings have been achieved, G&A expenses for the first six months were mainly influenced by increased expenses for IT services as well as expanding the G&A headcount.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/07/biontech-se-bntx-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2023 Q2","e":"bntx","d":"2023-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jens Holstein","x":"Yeah, I mean, from -- from -- for us, we of course can only talk for us and we cannot talk about Pfizer and their -- their cost-cutting plans that they have announced in their earnings call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/07/biontech-se-bntx-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2023 Q2","e":"bntx","d":"2023-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tazeen Ahmad","x":"…the difficulties involved and really getting a sense for the trends, but when you decided to maintain guidance, at least for now, what key factors are you taking into account that gives you confidence that -- that sales will be -- or revenues rather, will be at least close to, if not at,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/07/biontech-se-bntx-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2023 Q3","e":"bntx","d":"2023-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jens Holstein","x":"But, you know, those costs, I wouldn't call as something where you save money, deprioritization, as well as, you know, maybe being able to run clinical trials at a cheaper scale is something that we take as real cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/06/biontech-se-bntx-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2023 Q3","e":"bntx","d":"2023-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jens Holstein","x":"And that has been a big chunk of what we have where we can explain for the cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/06/biontech-se-bntx-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2024 Q4","e":"bntx","d":"2025-03-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jens Holstein","x":"Meeting these lower guidance ranges is a result of our continued cost monitoring and financial discipline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/10/biontech-se-bntx-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2025 Q3","e":"bntx","d":"2025-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ugur Sahin","x":"R&D expenses were mainly driven by the initiation of late-stage trials for our immunomodulators and ADC programs and partly offset by cost savings resulting from active portfolio management towards our priority programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/biontech-bntx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2025 Q3","e":"bntx","d":"2025-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ugur Sahin","x":"We are also reducing our full-year guidance for capital expenditures for operating activities to a range of $200 million to $250 million to better reflect our targeted investment in manufacturing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/biontech-bntx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2025 Q3","e":"bntx","d":"2025-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas Maffei","x":"I would say that the lower guidance on R&D is not about reducing spending on BNT327.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/biontech-bntx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2026 Q2","e":"bntx","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ugur Sahin","x":"We expect these cost savings based on prioritization and optimization to continue into future years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/biontech-bntx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNTX 2026 Q2","e":"bntx","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ugur Sahin","x":"But you're also streamlining the pipeline with the cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/biontech-bntx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[40,1,7476,0,0,0,5926,1168],[41,1,5359,0,0,0,4253,652],[42,1,10232,0,0,0,8349,1413],[43,1,9871,0,0,0,7803,1674],[44,1,9509,0,0,0,8443,719],[46,1,11623,0,0,0,8946,2359],[47,1,10237,0,0,0,8262,1366],[48,1,9859,0,0,0,8233,1059],[49,1,7734,0,0,0,5744,1626],[50,1,8271,0,0,0,7027,935],[51,1,10822,0,0,0,8642,1451],[53,1,9253,0,0,0,6640,1811],[54,1,9437,0,0,0,7954,914],[55,1,9638,0,0,0,7517,1510],[56,1,8952,0,0,0,7396,953],[57,1,8497,0,0,0,5946,1983],[58,1,9552,0,0,0,5942,2830],[59,1,9223,0,0,0,5556,2700],[60,1,8402,0,0,0,5611,2348],[63,1,6927,0,0,0,5557,599],[66,1,6990,0,0,0,6897,0],[67,